Hecker's Launcher derives from RisingOS Revived Ortus/Launcher3 and AOSP Launcher3.
Dynamic color and OmniJaws adapters preserve RisingOS/AOSP/OmniROM credits.
Lock-screen lyric matching/timing integration is adapted from Infinity-X.
