Lunaris theme resource APKs and Google Camera are not relicensed by this project.
The Lottie runtime is supplied by the ROM's external/lottie module (Apache-2.0).
Caracal Settings artwork and boot keyframes are generated assets from the approved
design references. No personal photographs, face templates or calibration are added.
